    "proximate_text": "In preparation of the temporary repair, the station did not validate that 2X sealant would perform properly under all plant operating conditions. During the Unit 2 scram vibrations from the main steam lines caused the 2X sealant to crack and separate from the valve stem, and the valve subsequently closed.",
